  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "从超过100种武器与升级中混搭，构筑每次都不同的毁灭高塔。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Mix and match from over 100 weapons and upgrades to make a different build every run.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3458500/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "恶魔契约会同时解锁自身潜力并强化敌人，需结合敌人伤害抗性选择。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Weigh the consequences of devilish pacts that will unlock your true potential, but will also affect how enemies get stronger. Each type of enemy is strong or weak against different types of damage, so choose pacts that fit your build accordingly.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3458500/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "用不同构筑撑过50轮可解锁未来局使用的新遗物，通关地狱门还会开放新难度与规则变化。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Survive 50 rounds with different builds to gain access to new relics to shape future runs. Beat each gate to unlock new difficulties that introduce new twists.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3458500/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
